    {
      "id": "test-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1224,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 1064.7,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263936",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CHECKABLE TEST / Proposed synthetic prototype session; not performed\n\nSet 1100 × 600; load 400 synthetic messages, four checked and 12 unrelated pending.\nAsk the operator to read Nora's long HTML and identify the safe entrance and time.\nThen stage only Nora for Archive, inspect pending work, and return to the same paragraph.\n\nPass checks: correct north entrance / after 09:30; no accidental write; pending becomes 13;\nexactly the same four unrelated checks; unread unchanged; body position restored.\nBefore Apply, ask which messages will change: expect all 13 pending, not the checked four.\nInject 10 confirmed / 2 failed / 1 unknown. Expect Recheck, no resubmit of the unknown,\nand no claim that Put back reverses the ten confirmed Gmail operations.\nRepeat keyboard-only; record wrong-target actions, focus loss and discovery time.\nCompare with current layout on equivalent mail; do not infer improvement from this sketch.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CHECKABLE TEST / Proposed synthetic prototype session; not performed\n\nSet 1100 × 600; load 400 synthetic messages, four checked and 12 unrelated pending.\nAsk the operator to read Nora's long HTML and identify the safe entrance and time.\nThen stage only Nora for Archive, inspect pending work, and return to the same paragraph.\n\nPass checks: correct north entrance / after 09:30; no accidental write; pending becomes 13;\nexactly the same four unrelated checks; unread unchanged; body position restored.\nBefore Apply, ask which messages will change: expect all 13 pending, not the checked four.\nInject 10 confirmed / 2 failed / 1 unknown. Expect Recheck, no resubmit of the unknown,\nand no claim that Put back reverses the ten confirmed Gmail operations.\nRepeat keyboard-only; record wrong-target actions, focus loss and discovery time.\nCompare with current layout on equivalent mail; do not infer improvement from this sketch.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
